n {:value "18000723"} "Rapid-Fire Pistol, 25 metres, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "18000728"} "Air Rifle, 10 metres, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "18000731"} "Small-Bore Rifle, Three Positions, 50 metres, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "18000737"} "Trap, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "18000740"} "Skeet, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "18000743"} "Air Pistol, 10 metres, Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "18000746"} "Sporting Pistol, 25 metres, Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "18000751"} "Air Rifle, 10 metres, Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "18000754"} "Small-Bore Rifle, Three Positions, 50 metres, Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "18000760"} "Trap, Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "18000763"} "Skeet, Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "18000766"} "Air Pistol, 10 metres, Team, Mixed"] "\n" [:option {:value "18000772"} "Trap, Team, Mixed"]] [:script {} "$('#same_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#same_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:form {:class "form-inline form-inline-header"} [:select {:name "id", :id "other_games_select", :class "form-control"} [:option {:value ""} "In other Games"] "\n" [:option {:value "2013152"} "2024"]] [:script {} "$('#other_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#other_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:a {:href "/event_names/2566"} "Event type"]] [:h1 {:class "event_title"} "Air Rifle, 10 metres, Team, Mixed" [:small {}]] [:table {:class "biodata"} [:tbody {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Date"] [:td {} "27 July 2021"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Status"] [:td {} "Olympic"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Location"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/2104"} "Asaka Shooting Range, Nerima, Tokyo"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/18000769"} "58 from 20 countries"]]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "On the afternoon of the fourth day of shooting competition, the second mixed team event was contested with the 10 m air rifle, following the 10 m air pistol mixed team event, which was held in the morning. The 10 m air rifle was also first held at the World Championships in 2018 where two Chinese teams won gold and silver. They were Zhao Ruozhu/" [:a {:href "/athletes/133193"} "Yang Haoran"] " and Wu Mingyang/Song Buhan but, of them, only Yang competed in Tokyo and he paired up with " [:a {:href "/athletes/141760"} "Yang Qian"] ", who had won the individual gold medal three days earlier. Also present in Tokyo were the 2018 World bronze medallists " [:a {:href "/athletes/146173"} "Anastasiya Galashina"] "/" [:a {:href "/athletes/135793"} "Vladimir Maslennikov"] "."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Yang/Yang won both qualification stages, but in the gold medal match " [:a {:href "/athletes/147242"} "Mary Tucker"] "/" [:a {:href "/athletes/136350"} "Lucas Kozeniesky"] " led 9-5 after seven series. The Chinese pair fought back to win five of the next six series but missed the chance to win gold in the 14th series, but did secure gold with the win in the 15th series. Like " [:a {:href "/athletes/141753"} "Jiang Ranxin"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/111749"} "Pang Wei"] " in the 10 m air pistol mixed team event hours before, Yang Haoran and Yang Qian both won their second medal in Tokyo, making Yang Qian the first to win two gold medals. The bronze medal match was decided after the 13th series, and went to " [:a {:href "/athletes/146177"} "Yuliya Karimova"] "/" [:a {:href "/athletes/135792"} "Sergey Kamensky"] ", who lost only four series in this match."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Pair"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Qualifying Round One"] [:th {} "Qualifying Round Two"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "1212/1220"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/141760"} "Yang Qian"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/133193"} "Yang Haoran"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CHN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-centr